{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 現正為 Marshall 藍牙喇叭全線推出優惠，主打型號 Acton III 減幅達 43%，現價只需 US$169.99，這款主打型號送海外要加 US$16 運費，但扣除運費也比本地價格便宜不少，因此很值得考慮！</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Marshall Kilburn III 便攜藍牙喇叭\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/81KKWBrgd2L.jpg\" width=\"2500\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"Marshall Emberton III 便攜防水藍牙喇叭\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/81A1OIQUTHL.jpg\" width=\"2500\"/></figure>\n<p>其他型號同樣享有大幅折扣，其中 Emberton III 現價 US$119.99、Kilburn III 現價 US$329.99，而體積最細的 Willen II 更是低至 US$79.99。雖然部分型號可免運費直送香港，但建議大家趁著這波全面降價，把握機會將心儀的音響產品帶回家。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Marshall Willen II 迷你藍牙喇叭\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/81yi-JWAa7f-L.jpg\" width=\"2500\"/></figure>\n<h2>Marshall 藍牙喇叭全線優惠重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>家用與戶外兼備設計</strong>：Acton III 採用 2 路驅動並更新波導技術，音場更闊且具備自動音量平衡；其餘型號則主打 IP67 防塵防水，適合沙灘露營或派對使用。</li>\n<li><strong>超長播放時間續航</strong>：Emberton III 提供超過 32 小時播放，Kilburn III 更長達 50+ 小時，即使全天外出也不用擔心電量不足，隨時享受無線音樂體驗。</li>\n<li><strong>標誌性復古外觀風格</strong>：全線沿用 Marshall 經典仿結他音箱造型，支援藍牙連接手機、平板及電腦，Acton III 另設 3.5mm 輸入方便接駁黑膠唱盤等設備。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FBHSDPBX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Marshall Acton III Bluetooth Home Speaker - Midnight Blue | Loud Stereo Sound with Bass and Treble Controls | Plug-in Powered | 3.5mm Aux Input\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41U8Gdu-CUL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FBHSDPBX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Marshall Acton III Bluetooth Home Speaker - Midnight Blue | Loud Stereo Sound with Bass and Treble Controls | Plug-in Powered | 3.5mm Aux Input</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$169.99</p>\n<p>$299.99</p>\n<p>-43%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FBHSDPBX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DDCJMDJC?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Marshall Emberton III Portable Bluetooth Waterproof Speaker - Black &amp; Brass | Rugged IP67 Waterproof &amp; Dustproof Design | 32+ Hr Playtime | Loud Stereo Sound &amp; Deep Bass | Wireless for Outdoors &amp; Travel\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412Fkj6qB1L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DDCJMDJC?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Marshall Emberton III Portable Bluetooth Waterproof Speaker - Black &amp; Brass | Rugged IP67 Waterproof &amp; Dustproof Design | 32+ Hr Playtime | Loud Stereo Sound &amp; Deep Bass | Wireless for Outdoors &amp; Travel</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$119.99</p>\n<p>$179.99</p>\n<p>-33%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DDCJMDJC?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F96FWCDF?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Marshall Kilburn III Portable Bluetooth Speaker - Black and Brass | Loud Stereo Sound with Bass and Treble Controls | 50+ Hr Playtime I Designed for Indoors and Outdoors | 3.5 mm Aux Input\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D0czclt8L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F96FWCDF?tag=newmo